# StrictDoc writes its output and its scaffolding into the folder it is given.
# None of it is source: the export is regenerated on every run, and the two
# files at the bottom are rewritten by StrictDocStarter each time the project
# is opened.
#
# The spec itself (01-11-spec.md) and the two grammars stay tracked.

output/
__pycache__/
strictdoc_config.py
strictdoc-theme.css
